  "text_md": "The SPIE NCU student chapter will support the 7 th Vacuum and Surface Sciences Conference of Asia and Australia. The 7 th Vacuum and Surface Sciences Conference of Asia and Australia (VASSCAA-7) will be held from October 5th (Sunday) to 9th (Thursday), 2014 at National Tsing Hua University, Hsinchu, Taiwan.\n\n![](<587a1f5a89db9e04752baea0b4f94a364b7a_pg7_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\nAbstract Submission\n\n# VASSCAA-7\n\n7th Vacuum and Surface Sciences Conference of Asia and Australia October 5 9, 2014, Hsinchu Taiwan\n\n![](<587a1f5a89db9e04752baea0b4f94a364b7a_pg7_pg1_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\nIBM Almaden Research Center, USA\n\nAndreas Heinrich\n\n![](<587a1f5a89db9e04752baea0b4f94a364b7a_pg7_pg1_images/imageFile3.png>)\n\nPvhsics Department at National Tsing Hua University , Taiwan\n\nShangjr Gwo\n\n![](<587a1f5a89db9e04752baea0b4f94a364b7a_pg7_pg1_images/imageFile4.png>)\n\nKanazawa University , Japan\n\nToshio Ando\n\n![](<587a1f5a89db9e04752baea0b4f94a364b7a_pg7_pg1_images/imageFile5.png>)\n\nLeader of Accelerator Section II, Accelerator Division, J-PARC Center, Japan\n\nMichikazu Kinsho\n\n",
